{{!-- context: recipientName, platformName, actionUrl --}}
<p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#6b7280;">Hi {{recipientName}}, 👋</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:26px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.2;color:#111827;letter-spacing:-0.02em;">You're in. Let's make you unforgettable. ✨</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;">
  Welcome to <strong>{{platformName}}</strong> — where brands and creators actually click. Your account is live. The next move is the fun part: polishing the story creators will fall for.
</p>
<div style="margin:0 0 20px;padding:14px 16px;background:#eff6ff;border:2px solid #181313;border-radius:12px;">
  <p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:#111827;">
    <strong>Why finish your profile? 🎨</strong>
  </p>
  <p style="margin:0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:#374151;">
    Creators decide who to work with in seconds. A clear brand name, logo, and vibe tell them you're real, ready, and worth their best work — so your briefs get better pitches, faster yeses, and collaborations that feel like chemistry, not cold outreach.
  </p>
</div>
<div style="margin:0 0 24px;">
  {{> actionButton url=actionUrl label="Complete my brand profile →"}}
</div>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#6b7280;">
  Two minutes now. Endless better matches later.
</p>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#6b7280;">— The {{platformName}} team 🚀</p>
